; /var/lib/bind/db.192.0.2: reverse zone 2.0.192.in-addr.arpa, team NN (Module 2, Lab 2.2).
; In the lab every team serves its own copy and nobody delegates it to you
; (resolvers answer it from a built-in empty zone, RFC 6303): ask your own
; server. Set the team number with sed. The ns1 line holds your VM 1's last
; octet; if your lab sheet subnet is not 192.0.2.0/24, delete that line.
$TTL 60
@       IN SOA  ns1.teamNN.example. hostmaster.teamNN.example. (
                2026102701 3600 600 1209600 60 )
        IN NS   ns1.teamNN.example.
30      IN PTR  ns1.teamNN.example.

; Lab 2.2: add PTR records for www (.80), mail (.81) and ftp (.82).
